usage: package-release.py [-h] [--platform {linux,windows,macos}]
                          [--output OUTPUT] [--build-root BUILD_ROOT]
                          [--app-binary APP_BINARY]
                          [--helper-binary HELPER_BINARY]
                          [--xwayland-archive XWAYLAND_ARCHIVE]
                          [--xephyr-archive XEPHYR_ARCHIVE]
                          [--iperf-runtime IPERF_RUNTIME]
                          [--mosh-archive MOSH_ARCHIVE]
                          [--mosh-source MOSH_SOURCE]
                          [--mosh-recipe MOSH_RECIPE]
                          [--unix-cache UNIX_CACHE]
                          [--browser-inputs BROWSER_INPUTS]

Build a native TermCraft release archive with a file and dependency manifest.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --platform {linux,windows,macos}
  --output OUTPUT
  --build-root BUILD_ROOT
                        Place independent Cargo target directories here.
  --app-binary APP_BINARY
  --helper-binary HELPER_BINARY
  --xwayland-archive XWAYLAND_ARCHIVE
                        Bundle the pinned Arch x86_64 Xwayland package (Linux
                        only).
  --xephyr-archive XEPHYR_ARCHIVE
                        Bundle the pinned owned Linux x86_64 Xephyr XDMCP
                        engine (explicit session network policy still
                        required).
  --iperf-runtime IPERF_RUNTIME
                        Root of the pinned Linux x86_64 Iperf runtime payload.
  --mosh-archive MOSH_ARCHIVE
                        Pinned Arch Linux x86_64 Mosh binary package.
  --mosh-source MOSH_SOURCE
                        Pinned corresponding upstream Mosh source archive.
  --mosh-recipe MOSH_RECIPE
                        Pinned corresponding Arch Mosh PKGBUILD.
  --unix-cache UNIX_CACHE
                        Bundle target-matching pinned Unix archives from an
                        offline upstream hash cache (Linux/Windows x86_64).
  --browser-inputs BROWSER_INPUTS
                        Offline pinned Chromium archive, signature and third-
                        party notices directory (Linux x86_64).
